# QHSE Dashboard Walkthrough

## 1. Directory & Code Structure

All dashboard files are consolidated under a single feature folder at [src/app/Pages/dashboard](file:///d:/Mazik/QHSE_Link/src/app/Pages/dashboard) to enforce encapsulation and ease maintenance.

```
src/app/Pages/dashboard/
├── dashboard.component.ts         <-- Wrapper (evaluates environment.location)
├── dashboard.component.html       <-- Wrapper template (selects layout)
├── dashboard.component.css        <-- Wrapper base styling
│
├── office-dashboard/              <-- Office-specific Dashboard
│   ├── office-dashboard.component.ts   <-- Logic, dynamic SVGs & filter simulation
│   ├── office-dashboard.component.html <-- Filters, KPIs, SVG Donuts, Data Tables
│   └── office-dashboard.component.css  <-- CSS grids, badges, and compact panels
│
└── vessel-dashboard/              <-- Vessel-specific Dashboard
    ├── vessel-dashboard.component.ts   <-- Vessel logic, SVG helper & demo triggers
    ├── vessel-dashboard.component.html <-- Vessel banner, KPIs, compliance queue
    └── vessel-dashboard.component.css  <-- CSS styling for vessel dashboard
```

