- **Routing**: In [app-routing.module.ts](file:///d:/Mazik/QHSE_Link/src/app/app-routing.module.ts), the `/dashboard` path was mounted under the parent layout (`site-layout.component.ts`) with `AuthGuard` checks to ensure authorization.
- **Sidebar Menu**: In [site-layout.component.html](file:///d:/Mazik/QHSE_Link/src/app/_layout/site-layout/site-layout.component.html), the **Dashboard** navigation link was added under the primary **QHSE** menu.

